  {
    "operation_id": null,
    "method": "PATCH",
    "path": "/internal/reports/{id}",
    "summary": "Update report status",
    "description": "Update the status of a report. Different users have different permissions:\n\n**PR Officers:**\n- Can approve pending reports (set to \"Assigned\")\n- Can reject pending reports (set to \"Rejected\")\n- Can optionally correct the category before approval\n\n**Technical Staff (Municipality):**\n- Can update assigned reports to \"In Progress\"\n- Can delegate reports to external companies\n- Can suspend or resolve reports they are working on\n\n**External Maintainers:**\n- Can update delegated reports assigned to them\n- Can set status to \"In Progress\", \"Suspended\", or \"Resolved\"\n- Cannot change the report category\n\n**Valid Status Transitions:**\n| From | To | Who |\n|------|-----|-----|\n| Pending Approval | Assigned | PR Officer |\n| Pending Approval | Rejected | PR Officer |\n| Assigned | In Progress | Assigned Staff |\n| Assigned | Delegated | Assigned Staff (via delegate endpoint) |\n| Delegated | In Progress | External Maintainer |\n| In Progress | Suspended | Assigned User |\n| In Progress | Resolved | Assigned User |\n| Suspended | In Progress | Assigned User |\n| Suspended | Resolved | Assigned User |\n",
    "parameters": [
      {
        "in": "path",
        "name": "id",
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "required": true,
        "description": "Report ID"
      }
    ],
    "request_body_schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "status",
        "explanation"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "Pending Approval",
            "Assigned",
            "In Progress",
            "Suspended",
            "Rejected",
            "Resolved",
            "Delegated"
          ],
          "example": "In Progress",
          "description": "The new status for the report. Must be a valid transition from the current status.\n"
        },
        "categoryId": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Optional corrected category ID. Only PR Officers can change this.\nExternal maintainers cannot modify the category.\n",
          "example": 3
        },
        "explanation": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Explanation for the status change (captured for audit trail)",
          "example": "Starting work on this report."
        }
      }
    },
    "response_codes": [
      "200",
      "400",
      "403",
      "404"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "Internal"
    ],
    "auth_required": true
  },
